    "acceptance_note":  "Directly unsetting a future priority bucket leaves priority 8 scheduled and causes two E_WARNING messages when WordPress indexes callbacks[8] and iterates null. The oracle records and suppresses both warnings so it can observe priority 10; production handlers may promote them to exceptions. WordPress then continues and completes the action under this oracle handler. Do not treat direct whole-bucket unset as warning-free behavior."
